PROJECT Inventory

TARGET PHP

PROFILE INVENTORY

USE cache.redis

DATABASE MYSQL

AUTH JWT

MODEL Product
    name STRING
    sku STRING UNIQUE

MODEL Warehouse
    name STRING
    location STRING

MODEL Stock
    quantity INTEGER
    status STRING

RELATION Product HAS_MANY Stock
RELATION Warehouse HAS_MANY Stock

VALIDATE quantity MIN 0

ROUTE GET /products
ROUTE POST /products
ROUTE GET /warehouses
ROUTE POST /warehouses
ROUTE GET /warehouses/{id}/stock
ROUTE GET /stock
ROUTE POST /stock
ROUTE PATCH /stock/{id}
ROUTE GET /inventory
